<title>MEXICO: Alfa's Versax raises stake in Nemak.</title>
<headline>Alfa's Versax raises stake in Nemak.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican industrial firm Alfa SA said on Monday its wholly-owned subsidiary, Versax SA, increased its stake in another of its companies, Nemak, to 80 percent from 60 percent.</p>
<p>The terms of the purchase were not disclosed. Versax bought the stake from Teksid, a subsidiary of Fiat SpA. Ford Motor Co controls the remaining 20 percent of Nemak, a leading producer of high-tech aluminum auto components.</p>
</text>
